  "mainEntity": {
    "name": "Is HH Remodeling LLC the Right Choice for Your Basement Renovation?",
    "text": "Is HH Remodeling LLC the Right Choice for Your Basement Renovation?",
    "@type": "Question",
    "answerCount": 1,
    "acceptedAnswer": {
      "text": "Is HH Remodeling LLC the right contractor to finish or renovate your basement? \n\nFor homeowners in the Denver metro area seeking hands-on craftsmanship, the answer is often yes. Founded by Abraham Becerra, HH Remodeling LLC operates as an owner-operated business with BBB A+ accreditation. Instead of dealing with disconnected sales representatives, clients work directly with Abraham as both the primary contact and the on-site lead contractor. \n\nWhat to Expect During the Process:\n- Hands-on oversight: Abraham’s core crew directly manages custom framing, drywall hanging, taping, trim carpentry, tile installation, and interior painting.\n- Trade coordination: Specialized trade work for plumbing and electrical additions is handled seamlessly, keeping your timeline moving without managing multiple vendors yourself.\n- Below-grade focus: We ensure moisture checks and proper insulation methods are prioritized before any wall is closed up.\n- Clear communication: As a small business, we maintain direct daily updates and transparent project coordination from the initial site visit through the final walkthrough.\n\nIf you value direct accountability and quality finish carpentry, reach out to HH Remodeling LLC at 303-505-0866 to schedule an estimate for your basement renovation.",
      "@type": "Answer",
      "author": {
        "name": "HH Remodeling LLC",
        "@type": "Organization"
      }
    }
  }
